"部分网盘与视频平台的协议实现参考了开源项目 YunX（https://github.com/CYQawa/YunX，AGPL-3.0），\\\n依照该许可，Cloudn 的完整源代码同样以 AGPL-3.0 开放。\n\n其他视频平台的解析分别参考了：ParseHub（https://github.com/z-mio/ParseHub，MIT License，Copyright (c) 2024 梓澪）、\\\nparse-video（https://github.com/wujunwei928/parse-video，MIT License，Copyright (c) 2022 wujunwei928）、\\\nyt-dlp（https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp，Unlicense / 公有领域）。\\\nYouTube 签名求解脚本取自 yt-dlp-ejs（Unlicense），其中打包了 meriyah（ISC License）与 astring（MIT License）。\n\n平台图标改绘自 Arcticons（https://github.com/Arcticons-Team/Arcticons，CC BY-SA 4.0），\\\n115、光鸭云盘、蓝奏云、蓝奏云优享版、AcFun 及后来新增平台的图标为本项目按同一规格绘制，同样以 CC BY-SA 4.0 提供。\\\n实心平台图标中，百度、哔哩哔哩、抖音、快手、微博、小红书、Pixiv、GitHub 取自 Simple Icons（https://simpleicons.org，CC0 1.0），\\\n其余由本项目在上述线性图标基础上绘制（CC BY-SA 4.0）；\\\n各平台名称与标识归其所有者，仅用于标明来源。\n\n标题字体为思源宋体（Noto Serif SC，SIL Open Font License 1.1）的子集，许可文本随应用一同分发。\n\n本程序不提供任何担保。详见源代码仓库中的 LICENSE 文件或 https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html。" = "Several cloud drive and video platform integrations are based on the open-source YunX project (https://github.com/CYQawa/YunX, AGPL-3.0). Cloudn’s source code is distributed under AGPL-3.0.\n\nOther video platform integrations draw on ParseHub (https://github.com/z-mio/ParseHub, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 梓澪), parse-video (https://github.com/wujunwei928/parse-video, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 wujunwei928), and yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp, Unlicense / public domain). The YouTube signature solver comes from yt-dlp-ejs (Unlicense), including meriyah (ISC License) and astring (MIT License).\n\nPlatform icons are adapted from Arcticons (https://github.com/Arcticons-Team/Arcticons, CC BY-SA 4.0). Cloudn created the 115, Guangya, Lanzou, Lanzou Plus, AcFun, and later platform icons to the same specification, also under CC BY-SA 4.0. Solid icons for Baidu, Bilibili, Douyin, Kuaishou, Weibo, Xiaohongshu, Pixiv, and GitHub come from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org, CC0 1.0). Other solid icons are based on the outline icons above (CC BY-SA 4.0). Platform names and logos belong to their respective owners and identify the source.\n\nHeadings use a subset of Noto Serif SC (SIL Open Font License 1.1), which is distributed with the license text.\n\nCloudn is provided without warranty. See LICENSE in the source repository or https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html.";
